1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,050
Narrator：Listen to a principal talking to students.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:09,190
This year's class trip will take place in June at Myles Standish National Park.

3
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:13,363
Make sure you bring sunscreen, a hat, a bathing suit,

4
00:00:13,363 --> 00:00:14,290
and a water bottle.

5
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:19,413
Your teachers will bring a fair amount of water in big bottles and jugs,

6
00:00:19,413 --> 00:00:23,210
but I'd like you to also have a water bottle on you at all times.

7
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:26,690
I don't want anyone getting sick from the heat,

8
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:30,130
so please bring a bottle from home.
